The project is named "SylServer".
Bring in "net" as net.

Print "Syl Web Server starting on http://localhost:8080".

Listen for HTTP on port 8080.

When a request hits "/":
    Print "Received request for homepage.".
    Reply with "<h1>Welcome to the Syl Native Web Server!</h1>".

When a request hits "/api/status":
    Print "Received request for API status.".
    Create a Dictionary called response_data.
    Set key "status" in response_data to "Online".
    Set key "speed" in response_data to "Native".
    
    Note: A simple string visualization of our dictionary.
    Set output to "{ status: " joined with key "status" in response_data.
    Set output to output joined with ", speed: ".
    Set output to output joined with key "speed" in response_data.
    Set output to output joined with " }".
    
    Reply with output.
